  triage:resolutionNote "fenix's ruling (PR #1408, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1408#issuecomment-5643246196): rejected, stale doc read -- the doc at the PR head already records the shipped pure signature (sprint-BA.4 line 195-196); no async reader/deadline/Result text remains in the doc. Exactness gate is met." ;
